88
00:41:06.000 --> 00:41:37.000
pass and that gives us hope that can be a very powerful antidote to a negative mind that is overwhelmed with chatter. Ethan and other researchers have also found it helps to give new labels to our emotions. When a negative voice inside you warns of all the bad things that could happen and you feel yourself getting anxious, relabel that anxiety. Another tool that can help people involves changing the way we interpret

